{"schemaVersion":1,"code":"C1-08","example":{"issue":{"title":"進入圓環之前，能否提早選對車道？","intro":"現況圓環的選道、步行與標誌資訊需要一起檢視。","images":[{"key":"results:c1-08-diagram-1","label":"現況圖","role":"diagram","rotation":0},{"key":"results:c1-08-diagram-2","label":"現況圖 2","role":"diagram","rotation":0},{"key":"results:c1-08-photo-1","label":"現況照片","role":"photo","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"lanes","title":"入口選道提示不足","text":"進入圓環前缺少清楚的指向線，駕駛不易提早選擇車道。"},{"id":"pedestrian","title":"步行空間偏窄","text":"圓環周邊的行人通行空間不足。"},{"id":"signs","title":"圓環標誌不完整","text":"缺少清楚的圓環相關標誌提示。"}],"photoStatus":"available"},"sourceSlides":[116,117],"strategy":{"title":"進環前選道，沿螺旋車道駛離","intro":"以預先選道、螺旋導引與分隔設計，減少圓環內的變換車道。","images":[{"key":"results:c1-08-strategy","label":"整體佈設圖","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"selection","title":"進環前先選對車道","text":"搭配指向線與方向標誌，讓駕駛在進入圓環前減速並選擇正確車道。","moduleId":"M1-02"},{"id":"spiral","title":"以螺旋車道減少交織","text":"沿螺旋路徑與實體分隔導引至出口，減少在環內變換車道的需求。","moduleId":"M2-02"},{"id":"markings","title":"整理入口、出口與穿越線","text":"清楚安排入口讓路線、出口導引線、車道分隔及行人穿越位置。","moduleId":"M1-01"},{"id":"signs","title":"讓標誌與環內路徑一致","text":"配置讓路、圓環遵行及安全方向導引標誌，對應進環選道與行駛方向。","moduleId":"M2-02"}]},"strategySource":{"file":"chapters/05-complex-scenarios/05-1-08-turbo-roundabout.typ","sha256":"fe948fcb88fc1e805854a96a53c070d7e858a15a36717be1a9f45a9da89c6a9c","scenario":"C1-08","title":"渦輪圓環","section":"交通設施設置建議與整體設置圖例"}},"assets":{"results:c1-08-diagram-1":{"file":"materials/05-複雜道路情境/current-conditions/C1-08/C1-08_現況圖_01.png","width":4138,"height":2600,"label":"C1-08 現況圖","scenario":"C1-08","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":116,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image140.png","sha256":"286fd21b8d19af514996262c8f2b7d15bd175a3b15d2d2280828b1a0badc769e"},"results:c1-08-diagram-2":{"file":"materials/05-複雜道路情境/current-conditions/C1-08/C1-08_現況圖_02.png","width":2248,"height":1412,"label":"C1-08 現況圖 2","scenario":"C1-08","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":117,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image141.png","sha256":"aa55c1a664cda033f0fb96cd8d